{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the summer of 1986 in Lakeshore: neon nights, mixtapes, and the warm glow of Sunset Video\u2014a mom-and-pop rental store hanging by a thread as the slick Video King chain moves in. You\u2019re a 20-year-old, player-named MC with a secret (you dropped out) and a dream you barely admit to yourself (becoming a filmmaker). Over one unforgettable week, you\u2019ll rally the town, save or lose the store, and fall in love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six fully branched romance routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path with <strong>Veronica</strong> (warm store owner), <strong>Helen</strong> (guarded goth), <strong>Lucy</strong> (sunny mascot), <strong>Chloe</strong> (shy coder), <strong>Tessa</strong> (tomboy best friend) or <strong>Sloane</strong> (aloof salon owner). Each woman has her own inner conflict, chemistry, and Act III story where you film a short starring her\u00a0from neon music-video vibes to moody horror and skate docu-drama.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices matter (no stat-grind, no minigames)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pure visual novel: branching dialogue choices only. Mid-game, your decisions lock a route (or lead to a solo \u201cdirector\u201d path). Your community actions also decide whether Sunset Video is saved or shuttered, a turning point that changes what follows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >14 endings, built for replay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 heroine endings</strong> (2 per route)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 philosophical solo ending</strong> (no romance, creative fulfillment)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 early bad ending</strong> if the store closes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SFW and comfortable by design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% SFW. Expect yearning looks, kisses, and tasteful fade-to-black.\u00a0 All characters are clearly 18+, all romance is clearly consensual, no explicit content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034290?t=1759947061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034290?t=1759947061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034290/d83a8760820999a8bef12c9b275d9a72d9d412fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759947061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034290/d83a8760820999a8bef12c9b275d9a72d9d412fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759947061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the summer of 1986 in Lakeshore: neon nights, mixtapes, and the warm glow of Sunset Video\u2014a mom-and-pop rental store hanging by a thread as the slick Video King chain moves in. You\u2019re a 20-year-old, player-named MC with a secret (you dropped out) and a dream you barely admit to yourself (becoming a filmmaker). Over one unforgettable week, you\u2019ll rally the town, save or lose the store, and fall in love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six fully branched romance routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path with <strong>Veronica</strong> (warm store owner), <strong>Helen</strong> (guarded goth), <strong>Lucy</strong> (sunny mascot), <strong>Chloe</strong> (shy coder), <strong>Tessa</strong> (tomboy best friend) or <strong>Sloane</strong> (aloof salon owner). Each woman has her own inner conflict, chemistry, and Act III story where you film a short starring her\u00a0from neon music-video vibes to moody horror and skate docu-drama.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices matter (no stat-grind, no minigames)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pure visual novel: branching dialogue choices only. Mid-game, your decisions lock a route (or lead to a solo \u201cdirector\u201d path). Your community actions also decide whether Sunset Video is saved or shuttered, a turning point that changes what follows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >14 endings, built for replay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 heroine endings</strong> (2 per route)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 philosophical solo ending</strong> (no romance, creative fulfillment)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 early bad ending</strong> if the store closes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SFW and comfortable by design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% SFW. Expect yearning looks, kisses, and tasteful fade-to-black.\u00a0 All characters are clearly 18+, all romance is clearly consensual, no explicit content.</p>","developers":["Warm Neon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034290/c91a5e1f027eb8f62560371cf38b2d06a2166f38/header.jpg?t=1759947061","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1 or newer, or Intel 64-bit (Core i5/Core m or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034290/1921183667/51712933eaf59a13918c2c46f7ac42831d951d48/1757837271/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758645111","dash_h264